--- plan.md 4.8 rules (as written) ---
wall: u = z x n, v = +z                                    n=[0,1,0] u=[-1,0,0] v=[0,0,1] -> MIRRORED
wall: u = z x n, v = +z                                    n=[0,-1,0] u=[1,0,0] v=[0,0,1] -> MIRRORED
wall: u = z x n, v = +z                                    n=[1,0,0] u=[0,1,0] v=[0,0,1] -> MIRRORED
wall: u = z x n, v = +z                                    n=[-1,0,0] u=[0,-1,0] v=[0,0,1] -> MIRRORED
wall: u = z x n, v = +z                                    n=[0.7071067811865476,0.7071067811865476,0] u=[-0.7071067811865476,0.7071067811865476,0] v=[0,0,1] -> MIRRORED
floor top: u = +x, v = +y                                  n=[0,0,1] u=[1,0,0] v=[0,1,0] -> MIRRORED
ceiling (underside): u = +x, v = -y                        n=[0,0,-1] u=[1,0,0] v=[0,-1,0] -> MIRRORED
