--- prototype triplanar (viewport-maps.wgsl: scaled.yz on x-facing, scaled.xz on y-facing) ---
column side facing +x: yz projection                       n=[1,0,0] u=[0,1,0] v=[0,0,1] -> MIRRORED
column side facing -x: yz projection                       n=[-1,0,0] u=[0,1,0] v=[0,0,1] -> reads correctly
column side facing +y: xz projection                       n=[0,1,0] u=[1,0,0] v=[0,0,1] -> reads correctly
column side facing -y: xz projection                       n=[0,-1,0] u=[1,0,0] v=[0,0,1] -> MIRRORED
